The '''Trapper's Den''' is a sub-location in the {{Zone|Mushroom Desert}} from the [[The Farming Islands]].

{{ZoneText|Complete hunting tasks.|Browse animal varieties.|Purchase new minions!}}

== Features ==
The '''Trapper's Den''' features multiple [[NPC]]s, including:
* {{NPCSprite|Trevor the Trapper}}, who who allows players to hunt for various animals for {{Pelts}}.
* {{NPCSprite|Talbot}}
* {{NPCSprite|Tony}}, who sells Tier XII [[Farming]] [[Minions]].
* and {{NPCSprite|Tammy}}, who explains the abilities of animals that {{NPCSprite|Trevor the Trapper}} tasks the player with finding.

